{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 12 från S.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 12 by S.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Traffic safety for mopeds and A-tractors", "dok_titel": "Traffic Safety", "forslag_text": "Parliament rejects the motions\n\n2025/26:554 by Isak From and Joakim Järrebring (both S),\n\n2025/26:724 by Malin Larsson et al. (S) demands 1 and 2,\n\n2025/26:1110 by Anne-Li Sjölund (C) demands 1-4,\n\n2025/26:1172 by Martina Johansson (C),\n\n2025/26:3021 by Lars Beckman (M) and\n\n2025/26:3653 by Aylin Nouri et al. (S) demands 40-42.", "notis": "Parliament said no to 120 proposals on traffic safety in motions from the general motion period in 2025.\nThe proposals deal with, among other things, speed limits and speed monitoring, measures against alcohol and drugs in traffic, traffic safety for mopeds and A-tractors, and driver training and driving licences.\nParliament refers, among other things, to planned or already taken measures and ongoing work.", "alternatives": ["Parliament rejects the motions\n\n2025/26:554 by Isak From and Joakim Järrebring (both S),\n\n2025/26:724 by Malin Larsson et al. (S) demands 1 and 2,\n\n2025/26:1110 by Anne-Li Sjölund (C) demands 1-4,\n\n2025/26:1172 by Martina Johansson (C),\n\n2025/26:3021 by Lars Beckman (M) and\n\n2025/26:3653 by Aylin Nouri et al. (S) demands 40-42.", "Reservation 12"]}, "votering_id": "6FA273BA-55FD-4605-841C-6D432DBC3AC5", "rm": "2025/26", "beteckning": "TU6", "punkt": 8, "dok_id": "HD01TU6", "datum": "2026-02-04", "utskott": "TU", "rubrik": "Trafiksäkerhet för mopedbilar och A-traktorer", 